    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "A sense of sharp focus settles over the one who carries this wood. It lends a predatory grace to the hands, as if the air itself waits for a command to ignite. Projectiles of searing heat and biting venom follow the direction of its tip."
